The direct PS5 connection (Remote Play without the PS Remote Play app) is based on
CouchSubs by Sinan Yorulmaz (https://github.com/yorulmazsinan/couchsubs, AGPL-3.0),
modified for Altyazı+ on 2026-11-25:
  - native/ (couchsubs_native.c/.h, couchsubs_crash.c, CMakeLists.txt; built as altyazi_rp.dll)
  - third-party/patches/ (chiaki-ng patches)
  - src/Ps5Altyazi/RemotePlay/ (CouchSubs.RemotePlay; Frame/ConnectStep from CouchSubs.Core)
  - src/Ps5Altyazi/PsnLoginWindow.cs (adapted from CouchSubs PsnLoginWindow)
  - .github/workflows/build.yml, "native" job (adapted from CouchSubs windows.yml)
CouchSubs: Copyright (C) 2026 Sinan Yorulmaz.

The Remote Play protocol implementation is chiaki-ng (https://github.com/chiaki-ng/chiaki-ng,
AGPL-3.0 with OpenSSL exception), included as a git submodule in third-party/chiaki-ng.
See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md for all bundled components.
